{"ancestors": "0,9013933,9022462", "bizKey": "9022463", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-12-08 21:03:35", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p><br></p><p>LPO，英文全称Linear-drive &nbsp;Pluggable Optics，即线性驱动可插拔光模块，在数据链路中只使用线性模拟元件，无需DSP或者CDR芯片。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/12/08/597bf930-649e-4b8b-8aba-241d5709a9b2-1702040398662.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 396.91px;height: 309.79px;\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LPO的优势</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>LPO的优势：低功耗、低成本、低延时、易维护。</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/12/08/842c2730-724b-4b05-87a0-ae4f80eafe76-1702040503468.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 395.97px;height: 337.45px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>LPO的劣势</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">（1）通信距离短，应用场景受限制</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">（2）标准化刚起步，互联互通存在挑战</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>LPO的增速</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>预计LPO光模块出货量从2023年的1.31万件增长到2028年的418万件，CAGR可达217%。</strong></span></p>", "firstLetter": "LPO", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "LPO", "parentId": 9022462, "pctChg": -1.88, "reason": "LPO，光模块新技术路线，具备低功耗、低成本优势，或将成为未来主流路线。", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9022463, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-12-08 21:12:19"}
